IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://iondistrict.com/wp
 -content/uploads/2026/08/Industrial-Growth-Series-banner-1.jpg.jpeg?ver=17
 86471191
